[17.08,"o","\u001b[1m\u001b[36m=== DONE ============================================================\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[17.16,"o","low-priv account -> reconstructed hidden /admin* -> proven invisible to that session ->\r\n"]
[17.24,"o","landed a cross-user BOLA, proven by the app's own sibling. No LLM in the decision path.\r\n"]
